WEBVTT

00:04:28.464 --> 00:04:32.112
other philosophers in the Greek 
and Roman tradition fled,

00:04:32.112 --> 00:04:35.717
and the city’s role as a center of 
learning declined.

00:04:35.717 --> 00:04:37.161
In a very real way,

00:04:37.161 --> 00:04:41.801
the spirit of inquisition, openness, 
and fairness she fostered

00:04:41.801 --> 00:04:43.521
died with her.